            "typeName": "notesText",
            "multiple": false,
            "typeClass": "primitive",
            "value": "The used stimuli of the emotion recognition task in the lab and the questionnaires are not shared in this publication package due to copyright. The stimuli are an adaptation of an existing data base and, while we were granted permission to adjust and use them for our research, we are not allowed to distribute them. \n\nThe original database was created by Frank Wallhoff and colleagues: https://www.jade-hs.de/team/frank-wallhoff/databases/"
